{"id": "unknown-2026-08-21-004", "date": "2026-08-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "How to protect solar assets from wildfires", "content": "<p>The number of forest fires across Europe is rising. Countries in Central and Northern Europe are also increasingly affected. This article presents a range of preventive measures to protect photovoltaic systems from fire and reports on experiences in France.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/how-to-protect-solar-assets-from-wildfires/\">How to protect solar assets from wildfires</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/how-to-protect-solar-assets-from-wildfires/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-21-005", "date": "2026-08-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "EU adopts budget-flexibility guidelines for photovoltaics, heat pumps, and BESS", "content": "<p>The European Commission has opened the door for Member States to use national escape-clause flexibility to finance energy security and fossil-fuel transition measures in 2026–2028. Eligible investments include renewables, batteries and energy storage, heat pumps, EV charging infrastructure and building renovations, subject to strict budgetary ceilings and eligibility criteria.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/eu-adopts-budget-flexibility-guidelines-for-photovolt", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/eu-adopts-budget-flexibility-guidelines-for-photovoltaics-heat-pumps-and-bess/", "type": "rss"}]}
